{"unit_id":"GMH13552__dsh-longrun-suite#card-zh","repo":"GMH13552/dsh-longrun-suite","commit":"f52bc35e784fde19cf249eb515bd1714ab3703f7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH LongRun Suite（DSH 网页端插件套件）：为长期科研与项目任务提供任务管理、结果验证和定时唤醒能力。它由 mission-control 工具维护持久化任务状态，支持验收标准、依赖、worker 领取与复核；LLM verifier 可比较候选、跟踪进展或生成多次尝试后评分选优；timer scheduler 可安排提醒并在到期时唤醒会话，网页端还提供提醒菜单。另含 Long-Run Captain 预设。适合需要拆分、跟踪并复核长周期工作的 DSH 用户。需要 DSH 与 Node.js 20+，验证器需配置可用的模型提供方和模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-mission-control/lib/index.js:336-358","packages/dsh-mission-control/lib/core.js:1-40","packages/dsh-plugin-llm-verifier/lib/index.js:186-220","packages/dsh-timer-scheduler-ui/lib/index.js:501-532"]}
